frame_time":1,"frame_order_type":"loop","frame_order":"","frame_interpolate":false,"visible":true,"internal":true,"saved":true,"uuid":"5f0f91d1-cdba-4ce2-9065-623e8ffea6b8","relative_path":"","source":"data:image/png;base64,"}],"animations":[],"description":"## spear_gnoll\n\nSpear cut from the gnoll's `gear_spear`, held by the warrior in the right hand (Patch 7, item 28).\n\nCut from `gnoll.bbmodel` as made, no redraw: the grip is at the origin with an empty `slot_grip` there, under `root`, and the piece points along -Z from the grip. Cut at 16/9 of the monster's drawn size, the size Jade built it, so it is not toy-sized in a person's hand.\n\n- Clips: `attack_polearm_thrust`, `guard_polearm`.\n- Length: 147 cm.\n- Cubes: 7.\n- Texture: 128x256, the monster's own sheet cropped to the faces used."}